ready: 1
kind: surface
id: consolidation.surface.review
module: consolidation
name: Review
surface_kind: screen
system: sys.cli
audience: The owner in an interactive terminal
summary: One held change at a time, with why it waits and what supports it.
elements:
- name: Held change
  description: >-
    The proposed memory, its kind, stack, the hold reason in words, its trust tier, and a summary of the
    cited evidence with dates
  copy:
    body:
    - 'Held because: {reason}'
- name: Choices
  copy:
    actions:
    - Accept
    - Edit
    - Reject
    - Skip
- name: Conflict panel
  description: The current memory beside the proposal when the memory changed after the proposal
states:
- Nothing left to review
- Read-only list when not run in an interactive terminal
